%% render: auto
%% title: Complete 3D asset production
%% desc: Not every asset needs every stage. ComfyUI-3D-Pack can host only the stages inside its boundary.
flowchart TD
    A["Approved reference imagery • authorized, masked if required"]:::slate
    B{"Select one generation approach"}:::purple
    subgraph CUI ["ComfyUI-3D-Pack native"]
    D["Stable Fast 3D • fast UV-unwrapped GLB, about 6 GB"]:::amber
    end
    C["SAM 3D Objects • real photo + mask, 32 GB"]:::amber
    E["TRELLIS.2 • supplementary, PBR GLB, 24 GB"]:::amber
    F["Geometry inspection • validate_asset.py"]:::green
    G{"Retopology required?"}:::slate
    H["MeshAnything V2 or Blender retopology • at most 1,600 faces"]:::amber
    I["UV and attribute validation • rebuild after retopology"]:::amber
    J["Dream Textures and Blender materials • PBR maps, color spaces"]:::amber
    K{"Skeletal animation required?"}:::slate
    L["UniRig skeleton and skinning • FBX"]:::amber
    M["Blender refinement • weights, rest pose, scale"]:::amber
    N["Animation or physics • only if the brief needs it"]:::teal
    O["Asset quality gates • Floor, Reflex, Finish"]:::green
    P["GLB / glTF • interactive"]:::blue
    Q["FBX / Blender source • editable"]:::amber
    R["Rendered frames • EXR or PNG"]:::teal
    S["Three.js • GLTFLoader"]:::blue
    T["Video composition • one timeline authority"]:::teal
    A --> B
    B -->|photo object| C
    B -->|fast prop| D
    B -->|high detail| E
    C -->|GLB| F
    D -->|GLB| F
